{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The public skeleton does not define the created_at serialization needed to classify files by creation year and month, and it does not state whether move_file creates missing destination parent directories. No directory-creation API is provided, so an executable mutation plan would require guessing these contracts.","missing_public_schema_fields":["file_system.show_file.response_shape.fields.created_at format and timezone semantics","file_system.move_file behavior when destination_file_path has a missing parent directory"],"task_id":"34d9492_1","task_family":"34d9492","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"Cannot safely plan the requested organization until the creation-timestamp representation and destination-directory creation behavior are publicly specified.","steps":[]}